hadiths[21]{hadithnumber,text}:
"365","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne sadqa fitr ek sa' khajoor ya ek sa' jau farz farmaya."
"366","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Ramadan ka sadqa fitr logon par farz farmaya: Har aazad aur ghulam, mard aur aurat Musalmanon mein se har ek par ek sa' khajoor ya ek sa' jau."
"367","[AI-translation] Ja'far bin Muhammad ke walid [Muhammad Baqir] (Rahimahullah) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne sadqa fitr har aazad aur ghulam, mard aur aurat par farz farmaya, un mein se jin ki woh kifalat karte hain."
"368","[AI-translation] Sa'id bin Musayyib (Rahimahullah) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne sadqa fitr gandum ke do mudd farz farmaye. Abu Ja'far kehte hain: Main ne Muzani ko kehte suna: Shafi'i (Rahimahullah) ne farmaya: Do mudd wali hadees ghalat hai."
"369","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Sa'id Khudri (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Ham Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke zamane mein ek sa' khajoor ya ek sa' jau ke siwa nahin nikalte the."
"370","[AI-translation] Hazrat Umar bin Khattab (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne ek ghoda bazaar mein bikte dekha, jabke unhon ne use sadqa kiya tha. To unhon ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se poocha: Kya main use khareed lun? To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Use na khareedo, aur na us ki nasal mein se kuch.'"
"371","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Umar (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Umar bin Khattab ne Apna ghoda Allah ke raste mein [jihad ke liye] sawari ke liye diya; unhon ne use bikte paya aur use khareedne ka irada farmaya. To unhon ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se is ke bare mein poocha. To Aap ne farmaya: 'Use na khareedo, aur apne sadqe mein wapas na jao.'"
"372","[AI-translation] Zaid bin Aslam ke walid [Aslam] (Rahimahullah) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Umar bin Khattab (Raziyallahu anhu) ko kehte suna: Main ne Allah ke raste mein ek ghoda sawari ke liye diya; jis ke paas woh tha us ne use zae kiya. To main ne us se use khareedne ka irada kiya, aur mera khayal tha ke woh use sasta bechega. To main ne is ke bare mein Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se poocha. To Aap ne farmaya: 'Use na khareedo agarche woh tumhen ek dirham mein de; apne sadqe mein wapas na jao. Kyunke apne sadqe mein wapas jane wala kutte ki tarah hai jo apni qae mein wapas jata hai.'"
"373","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Umar ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke zamane mein Apna ghoda sadqa kiya; unhon ne use bikte paya aur is ka zikr Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se kiya. To Aap ne farmaya: 'Use na khareedo aur us ke qareeb na jao.'"
"374","[AI-translation] Ubaidullah bin Adi bin Khiyar (Rahimahullah) se riwayat hai ke do aadmiyon ne unhen khabar di. Unhon ne kaha: Ham hajjatul-wada mein Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aae, jabke Aap logon par sadqa [zakat] taqseem farma rahe the. To ham Aap par bheed mein dhakke khate hue yahan tak ke Aap tak pahunche; ham ne Aap se us mein se manga. Unhon ne kaha: To Aap ne nazar uthai aur neechi ki; Aap ne ham ko do taqatwar aadmi dekha. To farmaya: 'Agar tum chaho [dun, lekin] us mein ghani ke liye koi haq, ya koi hissa nahin, aur na kamane wale taqatwar ke liye.'"
"375","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Mas'ud (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: 'Koi aadmi nahin jo apne maal ki zakat ada na kare magar us ke liye qayamat ke din ganja saanp banaya jata hai; woh us se bhagega jabke woh us ka peecha karega yahan tak ke us ki gardan mein us ka tauq dala jae.' Phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne ham ko parh kar sunaya: ﴿سَيُطَوَّقُونَ مَا بَخِلُوا بِهِ يَوْمَ الْقِيَامَةِ﴾ [Aal Imran: 180]."
"376","[AI-translation] Taus ke bete [Abdullah bin Taus] (Rahimahullah) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne [Taus ke bete] se kaha: Tumhare walid garaj sunkar kya kehte the? Unhon ne kaha: Woh kaha karte the: 'Pak hai Woh jis ki us [garaj] ne tasbeeh ki' [Subhana man sabbahat lahu]."
"377","[AI-translation] Ibn Abbas ke bete (Rahimahullah) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne [Taus ke bete] se kaha: Tumhare walid sawari par sawar hote to kya kehte the? Unhon ne kaha: Woh kaha karte the: 'Ai Allah, beshak yeh Tere rizq mein se aur Tere atiye mein se hai; to Tere liye hamd hai ai hamare Rabb Teri nemat par. Pak hai Woh jis ne hamare liye is ko musakhkhar farmaya, jabke ham use qaboo karne wale nahin.'"
"378","[AI-translation] Ja'far bin Muhammad ke walid [Muhammad Baqir] (Rahimahullah) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Ahl aur na-ahl dono se neki karo; agar tum ahl ko pa lo to tum ne ahl ko pa liya; aur agar ahl ko na pao to tum khud us ke ahl ho [sawab ke mustahiq].'"
"379","[AI-translation] Ja'far bin Muhammad ke walid [Ali bin Husain] (Rahimahullah) se riwayat hai ke Quraish mein se chand aadmi un ke walid Ali bin Husain ke paas dakhil hue, to unhon ne kaha: Kya main tumhen Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se bayan na karun? Unhon ne kaha: Kyun nahin; ham ko Abul-Qasim (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se bayan karen. Unhon ne kaha: Jab Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) beemar hue to Jibreel (Alaihis-salam) Aap ke paas aae aur kaha: Ai Muhammad, Allah Azz wa Jall ne mujhe Aap ke paas bheja hai Aap ki izzat, Aap ki sharafat aur Aap ki khususiyat ke liye. Main Aap se us ke bare mein poochta hun jo us se Aap se zyada janne wala hai; Woh farmata hai: Tum apne aap ko kaisa pate ho. Aap ne farmaya: 'Main apne aap ko Ai Jibreel ghamgeen pata hun, aur main apne aap ko Ai Jibreel ranjoor pata hun.' Phir woh agle din Aap ke paas aae aur Aap se wahi kaha; Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne unhen pehle din jaise jawab diya. Phir woh teesre din Aap ke paas aae aur Aap se wahi kaha jo pehle din kaha tha, aur Aap ne unhen waisa hi jawab diya. Aur un ke sath ek farishta aaya jise Ismail kaha jata hai, ek lakh farishton par, un mein se har farishta ek lakh farishton par. To us ne ijazat mangi aur Aap ke bare mein poocha. Phir Jibreel (Alaihis-salam) ne kaha: Yeh malakul-maut hai jo Aap se ijazat mang raha hai; us ne Aap se pehle kisi aadmi se ijazat nahin mangi aur Aap ke ba'd kisi aadmi se ijazat nahin mangega. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Use ijazat do.' To use ijazat di gayi; us ne Aap ko salam kiya phir kaha: Ai Muhammad, beshak Allah Azz wa Jall ne mujhe Aap ke paas bheja hai; agar Aap mujhe hukm den ke main Aap ki rooh qabz karun to qabz karun; aur agar Aap mujhe hukm den ke use chhor dun to chhor dun. Aap ne farmaya: 'Kya tum [aisa] karoge Ai malakul-maut?' Us ne kaha: Ji; isi ka mujhe hukm diya gaya hai, aur mujhe hukm diya gaya hai ke main Aap ki ita'at karun. Ravi kehte hain: To Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Jibreel (Alaihis-salam) ki taraf dekha; Jibreel ne kaha: Ai Muhammad, beshak Allah Azz wa Jall Aap ki mulaqat ka mushtaq hai. To Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne malakul-maut se farmaya: 'Woh karo jis ka tumhen hukm diya gaya hai.' To us ne Aap ki rooh qabz ki. Jab Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) wafat pa gae aur ta'ziyat aayi to unhon ne ghar ki taraf se ek aawaz suni: Tum par salam ho Ai ahl-e-bait, Allah ki rehmat aur Us ki barkaten; beshak Allah mein har museebat se ta'ziyat hai, har halaak hone wale se badal hai, aur har choot jane wali cheez se pa lena hai. To Allah par bharosa karo, Usi se ummeed rakho; museebat zada sirf woh hai jo sawab se mehrum raha. To Ali (Alaihis-salam) ne kaha: Kya tum jante ho yeh kaun hai? Yeh Khizr (Alaihis-salam) hain."
"380","[AI-translation] Salim bin Abdullah bin Umar (Rahimahullah) se riwayat hai ke Abdullah bin Umar ek aadmi ko fatwa dete jab use namaz mein naak se khoon aata, ya qae ghalib aa jati, ya mazi pata ke woh [wuzu karke] wapas laut jae phir wapas aa kar apni baqi namaz par bina kare [baghair dohrae jari rakhe]. Salim kehte hain: Jabke Miswar bin Makhramah kehte: Woh apni namaz shuru se padhe."
"381","[AI-translation] Nafi bin Sarjis (Rahimahullah) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Ham Abu Waqid Badri ki iyadat ke liye gae us marz mein jis mein woh faut hue; main ne unhen kehte suna: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) logon par Apni namaz mein sab se halki [padhne wale] the, aur Apne liye Apni namaz mein sab se lambi [padhne wale] Sallallahu alaihi wasallam."
"382","[AI-translation] Amir bin Mus'ab (Rahimahullah) se riwayat hai ke Taus ne unhen khabar di ke unhon ne Ibn Abbas se Asr ke ba'd ki do rak'aton ke bare mein poocha, to unhon ne unhen un se mana farmaya. Ravi kehte hain: To main ne kaha: Main inhen nahin chhorta. To Ibn Abbas ne kaha: '﴿وَمَا كَانَ لِمُؤْمِنٍ وَلَا مُؤْمِنَةٍ إِذَا قَضَى اللَّهُ وَرَسُولُهُ أَمْرًا أَنْ يَكُونَ لَهُمُ الْخِيَرَةُ مِنْ أَمْرِهِمُ﴾ [Al-Ahzab: 36] [Aur kisi momin mard aur momin aurat ke liye [jaiz] nahin ke jab Allah aur Us ke Rasool kisi mamle ka faisla farma den to un ke liye apne mamle mein koi ikhtiyar ho].'"
"383","[AI-translation] Hazrat Nu'man bin Bashir (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke zamane mein suraj grahan hua; Aap ghabra kar Apna kapda ghaseette hue nikle. Aap namaz padhte rahe yahan tak ke roshan ho gaya; jab roshan ho gaya to farmaya: 'Beshak log gumaan karte hain ke suraj aur chand bade bade mein se kisi bade ki maut ke siwa grahan nahin hote; aisa nahin hai. Beshak suraj aur chand kisi ki maut ya zindagi ki wajah se grahan nahin hote. Jab tum yeh dekho to namaz padho.'"
"384","[AI-translation] Hazrat Nubaishah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Ek aadmi ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se poocha aur kaha: Ya Rasulullah, beshak ham Rajab mein ateerah zibah karte the; Aap ham ko kya hukm farmate hain? To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Allah Azz wa Jall ke liye zibah karo jis mahine mein bhi ho; Allah Azz wa Jall ke liye neki karo aur khilao.' Abu Ja'far kehte hain: Main ne Muzani ko kehte suna: 'Aur Allah ke liye neki karo' , ya 'Allah Azz wa Jall ke liye wafadari karo'; shak Muzani se hai."
"385","[AI-translation] Hazrat Nubaishah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Ek aadmi ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se poocha aur kaha: Ya Rasulullah, beshak ham Jahiliyat mein fara zibah karte the; Aap ham ko kya hukm farmate hain? To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Har [charne wale] saimah [janwar] mein fara hai jise tumhara maweshi pale yahan tak ke jab sawari ke qabil ho jae to tum use zibah karo aur use khilao; kyunke yeh tumhare liye behtar hai.'"
